---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { DISCORD_URL } from '../../lib/links';
---

<Base title="Bot terms of service" description="Terms for using the FrightWorks Discord bot.">
  <section class="wrap page">
    <h1 class="display">Bot terms of service</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated November 26, 2026</p>
    <div class="prose">
      <ul>
        <li>
          The FrightWorks bot is provided free and as is, without any warranty. It may be wrong, change, or stop working at
          any time.
        </li>
        <li>
          Use it in line with the FrightWorks server rules and Discord's <a href="https://discord.com/terms">Terms of Service</a> and <a href="https://discord.com/guidelines">Community Guidelines</a>.
        </li>
        <li>Don't use it to share or request game files, disc images or other pirated content.</li>
        <li>The FrightWorks developers can limit or remove anyone's access to the bot.</li>
        <li>
          FrightWorks is an unofficial fan project. It isn't affiliated with or endorsed by Warner Bros., Hanna-Barbera or
          THQ.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Questions: ask a Moderator in the <a href={DISCORD_URL}>FrightWorks Discord</a>. What the bot sees and keeps is in
        the <a href="/bot/privacy/">bot privacy policy</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .page {
    padding-block: 56px 96px;
  }
  h1 {
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    color: var(--lantern);
  }
  .updated {
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: var(--faint);
  }
</style>
